    <summary>Chess Information Database (Scid v4 compatible)</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
NewScid is a Scid v4 database-compatible chess application written in Go (Wails v2)
and Vue 3 (TypeScript).

Features:
- Native binary support for .si4, .sn4, and .sg4 databases
- Interactive chessboard with legal move hints, scorebook notation, and replay controls
- Opening Tree Explorer with move statistics, frequencies, and Polyglot book support
- UCI chess engine analysis with evaluation bar and PV lines
- Spaced-repetition opening repertoire trainer and tactical puzzle drills
- 17 vector piece sets and 12 board color themes
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/chrisfair/newscid/releases</releaseNotes>
